ABOUT THE INSPIRATION

  This is an unofficial, independently written personal project, inspired
  by the impression left by the null² pavilion (Yoichi Ochiai) at Expo
  2025 Osaka, Kansai.

  It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or authorized by null², Yoichi
  Ochiai, or anyone involved in the Expo. No footage, audio, design data
  or program code from the actual pavilion is used; everything on screen
  is computed and drawn by this software at run time.

  The string "null2" in the repository name identifies the inspiration
  only. It does not indicate an official release or port.

  Copyright in this Software belongs to the copyright holder named above.

